[EN] All phase goals of § 6.7 project close-out (status per goal on this sheet). Pass: met, partially met, not applicable or phase not reached yet; "not met" blocks. Applies only to the "projects" path (project type einzelprojekt or both) — L321: "The division into ''concept for the overall system'' and ''projects'' is an elementary basis."; without a project type (M8203-01) the check waits. "Phase not reached yet": phase goals are "results to be achieved after completion of the respective service phase" (§ 2.1); the assessment is the project team''s (L202). "Partially met" passes here but triggers the Projektstopp review REQ-14-2 (§ 3: "If phase goals are not or only incompletely achieved, a Projektstopp review is required. A risk analysis must assess whether and how the project can be continued.").'
